((zo)) ((zo)) ((mo))

if you know how to use zo and ask, you already know the answer.

!! Interaction with other Magic Words

For every magic word, the interaction with all other magic words is defined.  This table covers all interactions of zo+word, where word is all magic words, both alone and within their grammatical contexts.

|| bu   | zo bu    | any-word | zo binds with bu, rather than bu binding with zo    |
        | zo .ybu  | any-word | zo binds with .ybu | *controversial
        | zo .abu  | any-word bu | zo binds with .a, bu binds with zo .a, creating the zo a letteral. | *controversial
        | zo zo bu | any-word bu | zo binds with zo, bu binds with zo zo, creating the zo zo letteral. | *controversial
   fa'o | zo fa'o  | any-word | zo binds with fa'o |
   lo'u | ...      | | |
   le'u | ...      | | |
   sa   | ...      | | |
   si   | ...      | | |
   su   | ...      | | |
   zei  | ...      | | |
   zo   | ...      | | |
   zoi  | ...      | | ||